ovation Fund pilot program.","evidence":"The Child Care and Development Block Grant Act of 1990 (42 U.S.C. 9857 et seq.) is amended... by adding at the end the following: SEC. 658U. CHILD CARE AND DEVELOPMENT INNOVATION FUND.","evidence_verified":false,"key":"scope","score":45},{"assessment":"Authorizes pilot grants for 5-year periods and reserves funds across fiscal years 2027 through 2031.","evidence":"The Secretary shall award the grant for a period of 5 years. A grant awarded under this section may not be renewed.","evidence_verified":true,"key":"duration","score":50}],"missing_information":["Total aggregate dollar amount of CCDBG appropriations from which the reservation is calculated."],"rationale":"Establishes a pilot grant program through the Child Care and Development Block Grant Act of 1990 to expand child care programs for parents working nontraditional hours.","score":50},"importance_meta":{"generated_at":"2026-10-26T13:32:01+00:00","model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","source_basis":"text","source_urls":["https://www.congress.gov/119/bills/hr7498/BILLS-119hr7498ih.htm"]},"introduced_date":"2026-02-11","is_demo":false,"label":"H.R. 7498","latest_action":{"date":"2026-02-11","text":"Referred to the House Committee on Education and Workforce."},"members":[{"chamber":"House","district":"2","id":"H001091","name":"Rep. Hinson, Ashley","party":"R","role":"sponsor","state":"IA"},{"chamber":"House","date":"2026-02-11","district":"1","id":"B001278","name":"Rep. Bonamici, Suzanne","original":true,"party":"D","role":"cosponsor","state":"OR"},{"chamber":"House","date":"2026-02-11","district":"7","id":"M001230","name":"Rep. Mackenzie, Ryan","original":true,"party":"R","role":"cosponsor","state":"PA"},{"chamber":"House","date":"2026-02-11","district":"1","id":"P000614","name":"Rep. Pappas, Chris","original":true,"party":"D","role":"cosponsor","state":"NH"},{"chamber":"House","date":"2026-02-11","district":"21","id":"S001196","name":"Rep. Stefanik, Elise M.","original":true